[h2]Maintenance & History Update - Version 1.18.3[/h2]

[list]
[*]Updated decisions, events, traits, religions, scripted effects, graphics, localization, and map data for CK3 1.19.
[*]Corrected invalid syntax, obsolete fields, broken references, missing localization, and decision tooltips.
[*]Improved Western Roman restoration state handling, integration effects, and army setup.
[*]Added historically researched title histories for the Western Roman Empire, Bosporan Kingdom, Gallic Empire, Imperial Pontificate, and Carausian Britannia.
[*]Added supporting historical characters, families, dynasties, claims, and sourced epithets.
[*]Improved compatibility references used by the official Immersive Toponyms patch.
[/list]

[b]Important:[/b] Start a new campaign to see newly added static title and character history. Existing saves do not import history files retroactively.
